Here is the semantic interpretation of the scene based on the provided ontology:

### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Nighttime Urban Intersection with Lane Change" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :description "Unpredictable lane change behavior by vehicles in low-visibility nighttime conditions" .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Yellow vehicle attempting abrupt lane change" .
:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Black vehicle following closely behind yellow vehicle" .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Potential occlusion from buildings and streetlights reducing visibility" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Low-light urban environment with artificial lighting" .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High risk of rear-end collision due to abrupt lane change by yellow vehicle" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.92"^^xsd:float .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Yellow vehicle intruding into adjacent lane without clear signaling" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.88"^^xsd:float .

:risk3 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to nighttime conditions and building shadows" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.88"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.70"^^xsd:float .
```

